WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.237
-Today, we got to see the
damning whistle-blower complaint

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:05.638
that sparked
the impeachment inquiry

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.340
over President Trump's
Ukraine scandal.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.642
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:11.177 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.879 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:13.879 --> 00:00:17.750
-So, yesterday, we saw the memo
from Trump's phone call

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.152
with the president of Ukraine,

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.020
and it was already
incredibly damning.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.223
The memo revealed a quid quo pro
in which Trump dangled

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:26.458
hundreds of millions of dollars
in military aid,

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:28.794
and in return,
pressured the leader of Ukraine

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:30.863
to investigate
a political rival, Joe Biden,

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:32.732
by literally telling
the president of Ukraine

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:34.634
to "do us a favor."

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.637
And as a general rule, you never
want to do Trump a favor

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:40.005
because it will always
go unpaid.

00:00:40.005 --> 00:00:43.176
In fact, it will very likely
be punished

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:44.944
because Trump will take
a liking to you,

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:46.279
make you part of his entourage,

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:48.481
and destroy your dignity
and reputation.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.649
I mean, just look
at Rudy Giuliani.

00:00:50.649 --> 00:00:53.286
The guy used to be
America's mayor,

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:54.820
and now he's constantly on TV

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.657
looking like he just fell
ass first onto a railroad spike.

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:59.492
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:02.529
And then we got to see
the full declassified

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:04.463
whistle-blower complaint
that details a series

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:06.933
of illegal actions designed to
get Ukraine to interfere

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:09.636
in the 2020 election
and then to orchestrate

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:11.404
a cover-up of those actions,

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.907
and you'll never guess
who was in the middle of it all.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.308
-From the whistle-blower
who says,

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:16.743
"In the course
of my official duties,

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:18.144
I have received information

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:20.079
from multiple U.S. Government
officials

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:21.714
that the president
of the United States

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:23.349
is using the power of his office

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.852
to solicit interference
from a foreign country

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:28.187
in the 2020 U.S. Election."

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:30.657
-This interference includes,
among other things,

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:33.159
pressuring a foreign country
to investigate

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:36.362
one of the president's main
domestic political rivals.

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:39.565
The president's personal lawyer,
Mr. Rudolph Giuliani,

00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:41.901
is the central figure
in this effort.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:44.069
-This person says they heard
from multiple U.S. officials

00:01:44.069 --> 00:01:46.372
that they were deeply concerned
by what they viewed

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.341
as Mr. Giuliani's circumvention

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:50.943
of national security
decision making processes

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:52.879
to engage with
Ukrainian officials

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:54.613
and relay messages
back and forth

00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:56.449
between Ukraine
and the president.

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.952
-Amazing, they concocted
an illegal scheme

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:00.719
to extort
the Ukrainian government

00:02:00.719 --> 00:02:02.455
to help them win
the 2020 election,

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:06.025
and they chose as their
go-between, Rudy Giuliani.

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.193
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:09.195
That's like if you planned
a bank heist

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:12.131
and made Mr. Magoo
your getaway driver.

00:02:12.131 --> 00:02:13.732
"Magoo, where's the car?"

00:02:13.732 --> 00:02:15.067
[ As Mr. Magoo ] Car?

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.870
I thought we were using skis!

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:20.506
[ Applause ]

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:23.676
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:25.344
[ Normal voice ] Then in
the hearing this morning,

00:02:25.344 --> 00:02:27.780
the acting Director of National
Intelligence, Joseph Maguire,

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:30.249
was grilled about his handling
of the whistle-blower complaint,

00:02:30.249 --> 00:02:32.218
and specifically Giuliani's role
in the scandal.

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:34.654
And Maguire said even he,
an intelligence official

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:35.755
at the highest levels
of government,

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:37.723
had no idea what Rudy was doing.

00:02:37.723 --> 00:02:40.460
-Were you aware of his role
or understanding

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:45.031
what his role was,
doing what you do?

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:48.033
-Congressman Quigley,
my only knowledge

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:51.904
of what Mr. Giuliani does,
I have to be honest with you,

00:02:51.904 --> 00:02:54.173
I get from TV and from the news
media.

00:02:54.173 --> 00:02:56.776
-Congressman,
all I know about Mr. Giuliani

00:02:56.776 --> 00:02:59.812
is what I see on TV, and, so,
all I can say is I hope

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:01.781
he gets his narcolepsy
cured soon.

00:03:01.781 --> 00:03:02.915
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.915 --> 00:03:04.350
I mean, lookit, why does
he always look like

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.585
he's being woken up in
the middle of a question?

00:03:06.585 --> 00:03:09.589
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:13.192
Of course, this would all --

00:03:13.192 --> 00:03:15.794
this would all seem like
a shocking abuse of power

00:03:15.794 --> 00:03:18.131
and obviously impeachable
behavior to any normal person,

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:19.832
and yet during the hearing
today,

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:21.701
Republicans on the committee
chose instead

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:24.470
to defend the president
like Congressman Devin Nunes,

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:27.140
who concocted an insane lie
about how Democrats

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.675
had also supposedly worked
with Ukrainians

00:03:29.675 --> 00:03:31.510
to dig up dirt on Trump.

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.246
-Today, they accused
the president

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:36.615
of pressuring Ukrainians
to take actions

00:03:36.615 --> 00:03:40.352
that would help himself
or hurt his political opponents.

00:03:40.352 --> 00:03:44.390
And yet, there are numerous
examples of Democrats

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.060
doing the exact same thing.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.094
Democrats on this very committee

00:03:49.094 --> 00:03:51.764
negotiated with people
who they thought were Ukrainians

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:56.035
in order to obtain nude pictures
of Trump.

00:03:56.035 --> 00:04:00.139
-I assure you, no one wants
nude pictures of Donald Trump.

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:02.975
[ Laughter and applause ]
In fact, nude pictures

00:04:02.975 --> 00:04:04.844
of Donald Trump
are the one thing

00:04:04.844 --> 00:04:07.313
that should be literally
covered up.

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:09.916
Also, if nude pictures
of Trump existed,

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:12.285
the first person to show them
to us would be Donald Trump.

00:04:12.285 --> 00:04:13.486
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.486 --> 00:04:15.154
Maybe that's why Rudy
always looks like that --

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:18.190
Trump just showed him
the nude pics.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.459
[ As Trump ]
Rudy, check these out.

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:20.693
I just got these developed.

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:22.495
Oh, look, by the way,
I broke my thumb.

00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:24.330
[ Laughter ]

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.432
That's not my thumb, Rudy.

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:28.100
You think you're looking
at my thumb.

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.103
But that's not my thumb.
I tricked you, Rudy.

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:32.505
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.505 --> 00:04:34.640
[ Normal voice ] But it's not
just Rudy Giuliani's involvement

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.709
that's detailed in
the whistle-blower complaint.

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:38.877
There are also explosive details
in the report

00:04:38.877 --> 00:04:41.313
about the lengths to which
the White House went

00:04:41.313 --> 00:04:42.448
to cover up their scheme.

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:43.516
Now, remember, they keep saying

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:44.850
there's nothing wrong
in the phone call

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:46.252
and everything Trump did
was appropriate,

00:04:46.252 --> 00:04:48.954
and yet today, we found out
that the Trump team

00:04:48.954 --> 00:04:51.190
actually went out of their way
to take the notes of the call

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.659
and hide them by moving them
from the place

00:04:53.659 --> 00:04:56.028
they're normally kept
to a high security location

00:04:56.028 --> 00:04:57.596
where very few people
would see them.

00:04:57.596 --> 00:05:00.366
-Here is where the alleged
cover-up comes in,

00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:01.801
"In the days following the call,

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:03.936
I learned from multiple
U.S. officials

00:05:03.936 --> 00:05:06.505
that senior White House
officials had intervened

00:05:06.505 --> 00:05:09.775
to lock down all records
of the phone call,

00:05:09.775 --> 00:05:12.578
especially the official
word for word transcript

00:05:12.578 --> 00:05:15.113
of the call that was produced,
as is customary,

00:05:15.113 --> 00:05:17.550
by the White House
situation room."

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.886
-The whistle-blower reports
that "the White House officials

00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:22.788
told me that they were directed
by the White House lawyers

00:05:22.788 --> 00:05:25.691
to remove
the electronic transcript

00:05:25.691 --> 00:05:27.226
from the computer system

00:05:27.226 --> 00:05:30.529
in which such transcripts
are typically stored."

00:05:30.529 --> 00:05:33.499
-The transcript was loaded into
a separate electronic system,

00:05:33.499 --> 00:05:35.768
when White House officials
describe the act

00:05:35.768 --> 00:05:37.670
as an abuse
of this electronic system

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.940
because the call did not contain
anything remotely sensitive

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:43.275
from a national security
perspective.

00:05:43.275 --> 00:05:45.311
-They took the notes
out of the normal system

00:05:45.311 --> 00:05:48.013
used for calls like this and
tried to lock them down by

00:05:48.013 --> 00:05:50.182
putting them into a classified
system to hide them,

00:05:50.182 --> 00:05:51.583
which makes it
incredibly obvious

00:05:51.583 --> 00:05:52.985
that this was a cover-up.

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:54.953
It's like if your husband
had a folder on his desktop

00:05:54.953 --> 00:05:57.223
that said,
"Work stuff, not porn."

00:05:57.223 --> 00:05:58.324
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.324 --> 00:06:00.092
I mean, honestly,
we're so lucky these guys

00:06:00.092 --> 00:06:01.393
are terrible at cover-ups.

00:06:01.393 --> 00:06:03.562
it was so obvious, people
caught onto it immediately.

00:06:03.562 --> 00:06:06.265
The president had a phone call,
and then his staff was like,

00:06:06.265 --> 00:06:07.633
"Put it in a separate system,"

00:06:07.633 --> 00:06:09.401
and a bunch of people were like,
"Why?"

00:06:09.401 --> 00:06:11.337
And Trump's staff was like,
"Uh, no reason."

00:06:11.337 --> 00:06:12.972
And then Rudy Giuliani
went on TV,

00:06:12.972 --> 00:06:14.273
woke up from his nap,
and screamed,

00:06:14.273 --> 00:06:15.441
"We did a cover-up!"

00:06:15.441 --> 00:06:17.042
[ Laughter ]

00:06:17.042 --> 00:06:19.378
And apparently, this wasn't even
the first time they've tried

00:06:19.378 --> 00:06:20.780
to cover up something like this.

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:22.948
The whistle-blower wrote
in their complaint

00:06:22.948 --> 00:06:24.917
that "According to White House
officials I spoke with,

00:06:24.917 --> 00:06:27.553
this was not the first time
under this administration

00:06:27.553 --> 00:06:29.956
that a presidential transcript
was placed into

00:06:29.956 --> 00:06:31.491
