00:06:31.491 --> 00:06:33.392
solely for the purpose
of protecting

00:06:33.392 --> 00:06:34.760
politically sensitive

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:37.830
rather than national security
sensitive information."

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.832
so they have a secret system
where they keep

00:06:39.832 --> 00:06:41.300
politically sensitive
information.

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:44.504
