00:06:48.307 --> 00:06:50.442
Controlled by large derners...

00:06:50.442 --> 00:06:52.744
Advising lawmarkers...

00:06:52.744 --> 00:06:54.813
-Yes, yes.

00:06:54.813 --> 00:06:56.982
Lawmarkers, as in when
they write up articles

00:06:56.982 --> 00:06:59.518
