he dragged Vice President
Mike Pence into his mess.

00:10:06.005 --> 00:10:07.907
Now, Mike pence is an expert

00:10:07.907 --> 00:10:09.642
at managing to stay
out of the fray.

00:10:09.642 --> 00:10:12.310
Remember that oval office
meeting with Pelosi and Schumer

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:14.880
where Pence basically tried to
teleport himself away

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.748
until it was over?

00:10:16.748 --> 00:10:18.584
And yet, yesterday,
when Trump was asked

00:10:18.584 --> 00:10:20.619
about his conversations
with the president of Ukraine,

00:10:20.619 --> 00:10:23.689
in which Trump asked him
to meddle in the 2020 election

00:10:23.689 --> 00:10:25.390
in exchange for hundreds
of millions of dollars

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.792
in military aid,
Trump, out of nowhere,

00:10:26.792 --> 00:10:28.560
dragged Pence into his mess.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:32.230
-I think you should ask
for V.P. Pence's conversation

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.366
because he had a couple
of conversations also.

00:10:34.366 --> 00:10:36.402
I can save you a lot of time.
They were all perfect.

00:10:36.402 --> 00:10:39.338
Nothing was mentioned
of any import

00:10:39.338 --> 00:10:41.406
other than congratulations.

00:10:41.406 --> 00:10:43.609
But the word is
that they're going to ask for

00:10:43.609 --> 00:10:45.978
the first phone conversation.

00:10:45.978 --> 00:10:48.614
You can have it
any time you need it.

00:10:48.614 --> 00:10:51.516
And also Mike Pence's
conversations,

00:10:51.516 --> 00:10:53.786
which were, I think,
one or two of them.

00:10:53.786 --> 00:10:54.987
They were perfect.

00:10:54.987 --> 00:10:57.156
-Damn, he's taking Mike Pence
down with him.

00:10:57.156 --> 00:11:00.693
It's like when the cops separate
two suspects in a murder case.

00:11:00.693 --> 00:11:01.760
The one guy's like,
"I'll never talk,"

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.928
and the other guy is like,

00:11:02.928 --> 00:11:04.062
[ As Trump ]
You should talk to Mike Pence.

00:11:04.062 --> 00:11:05.897
It was all his idea.

00:11:05.897 --> 00:11:07.766
[ Normal voice ] And it's not
just Mike Pence who is now

00:11:07.766 --> 00:11:09.201
implicated in this whole mess.

00:11:09.201 --> 00:11:10.636
There is also
Attorney General William Barr.

00:11:10.636 --> 00:11:12.271
Yesterday, we learned
that Trump's Ukraine call

00:11:12.271 --> 00:11:14.406
was referred to
the Department of Justice

00:11:14.406 --> 00:11:16.541
as a possible crime, and that
Barr's team shut it down.

00:11:16.541 --> 00:11:18.944
Barr was also mentioned multiple
times in the notes

00:11:18.944 --> 00:11:21.179
from the phone call and then
in the report released today,

00:11:21.179 --> 00:11:22.882
the whistle-blower
said explicitly

00:11:22.882 --> 00:11:25.450
that Attorney General Barr
appears to be involved as well,

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:28.921
which means Barr may have been
lying during this exchange

00:11:28.921 --> 00:11:30.822
with Senator Kamala Harris
back in May.

00:11:30.822 --> 00:11:33.158
-Has the president or anyone
at the White House

00:11:33.158 --> 00:11:37.429
ever asked or suggested that you
open an investigation of anyone?

00:11:37.429 --> 00:11:39.297
Yes or no, please, sir.

00:11:39.297 --> 00:11:43.302
-Um, the president
or anybody else.

00:11:43.302 --> 00:11:46.271
-Seems you'd remember
something like that

00:11:46.271 --> 00:11:47.639
and be able to tell us.

00:11:47.639 --> 00:11:50.642
-Yeah, but I'm trying to grapple
with the word, suggest.

00:11:50.642 --> 00:11:54.412
I mean, there have been
discussions of matters out there

00:11:54.412 --> 00:11:59.051
that -- they have not asked me
to open an investigation,

00:11:59.051 --> 00:12:00.619
but --
-Perhaps they've suggested?

00:12:00.619 --> 00:12:02.254
-I don't know.
I wouldn't say, suggest.

00:12:02.254 --> 00:12:04.089
-Hinted?
-I don't know.

00:12:04.089 --> 00:12:07.158
-Inferred?

00:12:07.158 --> 00:12:08.760
You don't know. Okay.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:09.995
-I mean, look at her face.

00:12:09.995 --> 00:12:12.797
She's questioning him the way
you ask your son,

00:12:12.797 --> 00:12:15.467
"Do you smoke weed?" when
you've already found the weed.

00:12:15.467 --> 00:12:16.969
[ Laughter ]

00:12:16.969 --> 00:12:18.570
But for real, you know
someone's lying

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:19.871
when that's how they respond.

00:12:19.871 --> 00:12:22.341
It's like if your boss at Kinkos
comes to you and says,

00:12:22.341 --> 00:12:24.843
"Hey, Brad, did you get drunk,
sit on the copier,

00:12:24.843 --> 00:12:27.746
photocopy your ass, and put it
up in the break room?"

00:12:27.746 --> 00:12:30.549
and your answer is,
"Uh [Mumbling]

00:12:30.549 --> 00:12:34.086
[ Laughter ]

00:12:34.086 --> 00:12:38.290
Yeah, I'm just trying to grapple
with the word 'photocopy'."

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:39.791
[ Laughter ]

00:12:39.791 --> 00:12:41.827
Yeah. It was you then.

00:12:41.827 --> 00:12:43.262
You put it up in the break room.

00:12:43.262 --> 00:12:45.931
[ Cheers and applause ]
And then there is

00:12:45.931 --> 00:12:47.666
the State Department's role
in all of this.

00:12:47.666 --> 00:12:49.735
For example, in an interview
on Fox News this week,

00:12:49.735 --> 00:12:51.936
Giuliani actually admitted
that the State Department

00:12:51.936 --> 00:12:53.705
was also involved
in this scandal

00:12:53.705 --> 00:12:56.341
by asking him to take
a phone call with an official

00:12:56.341 --> 00:12:59.411
in Ukraine to manufacture
a baseless smear against Biden.

00:12:59.411 --> 00:13:01.580
-You didn't get involved in this
on your own.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:04.716
Did our State Department ask you
to go on a mission for them?

00:13:04.716 --> 00:13:06.084
-They did.

00:13:06.084 --> 00:13:07.953
-Oh, my God, Rudy,
why do you keep going on TV

00:13:07.953 --> 00:13:09.188
and confessing this stuff?

00:13:09.188 --> 00:13:10.322
[ Laughter ]

00:13:10.322 --> 00:13:11.890
Here's my theory --
when Rudy and Trump

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.592
and their cohorts are huddled
in the White House

00:13:13.592 --> 00:13:14.893
or on Air Force One,

00:13:14.893 --> 00:13:16.495
they all make perfect sense
to each other, right?

00:13:16.495 --> 00:13:18.830
They don't even realize the
plans they're making are crimes.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.398
It's like when you
and your friends take mushrooms

00:13:20.398 --> 00:13:22.234
in the back bedroom and you're
throwing theories around.

00:13:22.234 --> 00:13:23.269
You feel like geniuses.

00:13:23.269 --> 00:13:24.536
Then you leave the bedroom,

00:13:24.536 --> 00:13:26.204
but you forgot your mom's
having her book club.

00:13:26.204 --> 00:13:28.306
And suddenly the moment
they all look at you,

00:13:28.306 --> 00:13:31.210
you realize, "Oh, no,
we're really [bleep] high."

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:32.544
[ Laughter ]

00:13:32.544 --> 00:13:35.647
I mean, seriously, that fast.
He gives it up that fast.

00:13:35.647 --> 00:13:38.983
Can you imagine Rudy's episode
of "Law &amp; Order"?

00:13:38.983 --> 00:13:40.553
[ "The Clang" plays ]

00:13:40.553 --> 00:13:43.521
-Did our State Department ask
you to go on a mission for them?

00:13:43.521 --> 00:13:44.723
-They did.

00:13:44.723 --> 00:13:46.724
[ Outro for "Law &amp; Order"
plays ]

00:13:46.724 --> 00:13:50.129
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:13:50.129 --> 00:13:56.001
-Then, Rudy admitted again
during an interview on Fox News,

00:13:56.001 --> 00:13:57.936
where he literally held up
his phone to show his calls

00:13:57.936 --> 00:13:59.204
from the State Department.

00:13:59.204 --> 00:14:00.672
That came after
a "Washington Post" report

00:14:00.672 --> 00:14:01.807
in which White House insiders

00:14:01.807 --> 00:14:03.042
tried to blame Rudy
for everything.

00:14:03.042 --> 00:14:04.577
According to those insiders,

00:14:04.577 --> 00:14:06.478
the person who appears to have
been more directly involved

00:14:06.478 --> 00:14:07.679
in nearly every stage

00:14:07.679 --> 00:14:09.881
of the entanglement with Ukraine
is Giuliani.

00:14:09.881 --> 00:14:12.417
"Rudy, he did all of this,"
one U.S. official said.

00:14:12.417 --> 00:14:13.618
"This [bleep] show
that we're in,

00:14:13.618 --> 00:14:16.021
it's him injecting himself
into the process."

00:14:16.021 --> 00:14:17.222
Oh, man, I love it.

00:14:17.222 --> 00:14:19.324
They're all trying to blame
each other now.

00:14:19.324 --> 00:14:21.493
This is like the end
of "Reservoir Dogs"

00:14:21.493 --> 00:14:24.162
where everybody's pointing a gun
at someone else.

00:14:24.162 --> 00:14:27.032
You've got Mr. Orange.
He's blaming Mr. White.

00:14:27.032 --> 00:14:29.368
And everybody's mad at Mr. Red.

00:14:29.368 --> 00:14:30.536
[ Laughter ]

00:14:30.536 --> 00:14:32.805
What we saw today in this
whistle-blower complaint

00:14:32.805 --> 00:14:34.373
is impeachable behavior
on its own,

00:14:34.373 --> 00:14:36.074
let alone all the other ways
in which Trump

00:14:36.074 --> 00:14:37.843
has abused his power
over the last two years.

00:14:37.843 --> 00:14:39.611
And now that things are getting
really bad,

00:14:39.611 --> 00:14:41.279
they're trying to pin it
on each other

00:14:41.279 --> 00:14:42.781
with the White House
blaming Rudy,

00:14:42.781 --> 00:14:44.049
Rudy blaming
the State Department,

00:14:44.049 --> 00:14:45.317
and Trump blaming Pence.

00:14:45.317 --> 00:14:49.521
In fact, if both Trump and Pence
get removed from office,

00:14:49.521 --> 00:14:51.957
the next person in the line
of succession

00:14:51.957 --> 00:14:54.859
would be Nancy Pelosi,
in which case,

00:14:54.859 --> 00:14:56.862
it would actually be true
that...

00:14:56.862 --> 00:14:58.763
-She's no longer
the Speaker of the House.

00:14:58.763 --> 00:15:00.666
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:15:00.666 --> 00:15:02.134 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:15:02.134 --> 00:15:04.370 line:0%
♪♪

